  "description_text": "Description: Style meets comfort with our Dual-Tone Magnetic Smartwatch Bands. Designed with a flexible magnetic closure for a secure fit and effortless wear, these bands combine durability with a modern two-tone look. Perfect for both casual and formal outfits, they bring a premium upgrade to your smartwatch. ✅ Available in sizes: 40mm, 41mm, 42mm, 44mm, 45mm, 46mm, 49mm ✅ Dual-color combinations: Black + Grey, Orange + Midnight, Blue + Midnight, Cloud Grey + Blue, Green + Deep Blue, Starlight + Pink ✅ Comfortable, durable, and easy to snap on/off A stylish companion for everyday wear that keeps your watch looking fresh and elegant.",
  "description_html": "<p>Description:<br>Style meets comfort with our Dual-Tone Magnetic Smartwatch Bands. Designed with a flexible magnetic closure for a secure fit and effortless wear, these bands combine durability with a modern two-tone look. Perfect for both casual and formal outfits, they bring a premium upgrade to your smartwatch.</p>\n<p>✅ Available in sizes: 40mm, 41mm, 42mm, 44mm, 45mm, 46mm, 49mm<br>✅ Dual-color combinations: Black + Grey, Orange + Midnight, Blue + Midnight, Cloud Grey + Blue, Green + Deep Blue, Starlight + Pink<br>✅ Comfortable, durable, and easy to snap on/off</p>\n<p>A stylish companion for everyday wear that keeps your watch looking fresh and elegant.</p>"
